    "title": "Get a seller inquiry"
  },
  "description": "One automatic seller inquiry of the caller's workspace: vehicle and listing references, state, bound qualification revision, authorization and template versions, language, recipient verification status (the address only for the owner), send attempts, delivery uncertainty, suppression and timestamps. Read-only; there is no send tool.",
